/* 用户卡：与首页 Hero 卡统一样式（浅色柔渐变 + 左侧 accent + 柔光 + 微立体），仅底色微调为品牌蓝浅色 */
.user-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E9F1FF 0%, #D9E9FF 55%, #CBE2FF 100%);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--brand-border);
  border-left: 6rpx solid var(--brand);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 44rpx 32rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* 角落柔光，增加层次但不加重底色（与 Hero 一致） */
.user-card::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: -60rpx;
  right: -30rpx;
  width: 220rpx;
  height: 220rpx;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.avatar {
  width: 104rpx;
  height: 104rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--brand);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  margin-right: 28rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  box-shadow: 0 6rpx 16rpx rgba(28, 130, 245, 0.28);
}
.user-info {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.user-name {
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-1);
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
  letter-spacing: -0.3rpx;
}
.user-sub {
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.logout-wrap {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
}
.value-link {
  color: var(--brand) !important;
}
.logout-btn {
  width: 100%;
  height: 92rpx;
  line-height: 90rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.logout-btn::after { border: none; }
